WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.600
Obviously, in a top two, top three event for us at the club,

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300
we were able to blow the horn.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.000
We got everybody in a safe space,

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.100
either in the clubhouse here, at the halfway house.

5
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.300
Everybody was under shelter,

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.100
and then the lightning came.
